  "conclusion": "The eight first outputs across four paired cases support grounded analysis and broadly comparable answer quality. Those eight runs did not test saving, persistent continuation or user operation benefits. Separate final daily-window evidence for the new workflow is summarized in workflowVerification; it does not change these quality scores. The predeclared fallback retains bounded convenient analysis, collection and traceable continuation. Superior reasoning, exhaustive recall, lower fees, human adoption and long-term value are not established.",
